  "body": "Elevated for all-day sun, privacy, and sweeping sea views, 19 Vista Motu sits in a quiet, sought-after Red Beach street. Built in solid brick and weatherboard across two levels, it greets you with a grand double-height entry, and huge off-street parking for the motorhome, boat, camper, and extra cars.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n* 4 Bedrooms & 2 Bathrooms: Master suite upstairs with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, plus 3 bedrooms (2 doubles, 1 single), a family bathroom and separate toilet. \r\n* 2 Living Areas: Open-plan family and dining room upstairs with a heat pump, plus a separate downstairs lounge opening to the yard-great for teens, guests, or working from home.\r\n* Modern Kitchen: Updated kitchen with an island bench, breakfast nook/sitting area, and leafy outlooks.\r\n* North-Facing Balcony: Sunny timber deck overlooking palm trees out to the ocean.\r\n* Double Garage & Extensive Parking: Internal-access double garage with laundry space, room for a workshop bench, and wide concrete off-street parking easily fitting a motorhome, boat, camper, and extra vehicles.\r\n* The Location: A short walk to Red Beach, and minutes from Orewa Beach, parks, cafes, restaurants, the pharmacy, Coast Plaza, and supermarkets.\r\n\r\nIdeal for families needing teen separation, multi-generational living, or anyone wanting space for the boat, motorhome, and weekend toys.\r\n\r\nCome see it at the open home or call Zena Van Wijk or Kait Rutten today to arrange a private viewing!\r\n\r\nGlenfield: Auction: 4:00pm, Wednesday 16th December 2026 In Rooms, Ray White Glenfield, Glenfield Mall (unless sold prior). You can watch the auction live here https://rwcarpenterrealty.co.nz/watch-our-auctions-live",
